 3: /**
 4:  * THE CONTRACT - one map's camera override.
 5:  *
 6:  * An entry of this system is a map (or a set of maps sharing one override):
 7:  * one file, one exported `<name>Layer`, one line in `layers.ts`. Entries are
 8:  * pure data; the facade (`index.ts`) owns all state and math. Maps without an
 9:  * entry get the wheel-zoom distance levels (`recipes.ts`).
10:  *
11:  * Values are in original-client units (100 per tile), straight from
12:  * CameraUtility.cpp, so they stay comparable against the reference source.
