 46:  * how long Nova has been held, behind one
 47:  * object. Copy `_template.ts` when adding to it.
 48:  *
 49:  * The game talks to `combat.update` once a frame (from `AttackSystem`, the
 50:  * first fighting system of the frame) and `combat.reset` on a map change;
 51:  * both fan out over `COMBAT_LAYERS` (`layers.ts`), the only list of
 52:  * entries in the codebase. The readers and commands below are the facade's
 53:  * public surface for the ECS consumers; every entry file stays importable
 54:  * directly for anything that needs a single function.
